#. module: bf_budget_subscription
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_budget_subscription.field_bf_budget_line__subscription_no_calendar_ids
msgid ""
"On-demand subscriptions linked to this budget item: they spend without a "
"schedule, so the calendar-based theoretical amount does not cover them."
msgstr ""
"Abonnements à la demande rattachés à ce poste : ils dépensent sans "
"calendrier, donc le théorique de calendrier ne les couvre pas."

#. module: bf_budget_subscription
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_budget_subscription.field_bf_budget_subscription_link_wizard__only_unassigned
msgid "Only those without a budget item"
msgstr "Seulement ceux qui n'ont pas de poste"

#. module: bf_budget_subscription
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_budget_subscription.bf_budget_line_form_subscription
msgid "Recurring commitments"
msgstr "Engagements récurrents"

#. module: bf_budget_subscription
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_budget_subscription.field_bf_budget_line__subscription_count
msgid "Subscription Count"
msgstr "Nombre d'abonnements"

#. module: bf_budget_subscription
#: model:ir.model,name:bf_budget_subscription.model_bf_budget_subscription_link_wizard
msgid "Subscription linking to budget items"
msgstr "Rattacher les abonnements aux postes budgétaires"

#. module: bf_budget_subscription
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_budget_subscription.field_bf_budget_line__subscription_no_calendar_ids
msgid "Subscriptions without a schedule"
msgstr "Abonnements sans échéancier"

#. module: bf_budget_subscription
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_budget_subscription.bf_budget_subscription_link_wizard_form
msgid ""
"The budget item is inferred from the expense account that carries most of "
"each subscription's bills. Ambiguous cases are not settled at random: they "
"are listed and left to be done by hand."
msgstr ""
"Le poste se déduit du compte de charge qui porte le plus gros des\n"
"                    factures de chaque abonnement. Les cas ambigus ne sont pas tranchés au\n"
"                    hasard : ils sont listés et restent à faire à la main."

#. module: bf_budget_subscription
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_budget_subscription.field_subscription_subscription__budget_position_id
msgid ""
"The budget item whose budgets count this subscription. Inferred from vendor "
"bills by the linking wizard."
msgstr ""
"Le poste dont les budgets comptent cet abonnement. Se déduit des factures "
"fournisseur par l'assistant de rattachement."

#. module: bf_budget_subscription
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_budget_subscription.field_bf_budget_line__subscription_ids
msgid ""
"The subscriptions whose budget item is the one on this line. The list is "
"computed: linking a subscription to a budget item is enough, nothing needs "
"to be copied into the budgets."
msgstr ""
"Les abonnements dont le poste est celui de cette ligne. La liste se calcule "
": rattacher un abonnement à un poste suffit, il n'y a rien à reporter dans "
"les budgets."

#. module: bf_budget_subscription
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_budget_subscription.subscription_form_budget
msgid ""
"This subscription spends without a schedule: budgets cannot forecast its "
"next due date."
msgstr ""
"Cet abonnement dépense sans échéancier : les budgets ne peuvent pas\n"
"                    prévoir sa prochaine échéance."

#. module: bf_budget_subscription
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_budget_subscription.field_bf_budget_subscription_link_wizard__only_unassigned
msgid "Uncheck to also reconsider subscriptions that are already linked."
msgstr "Décocher pour reconsidérer aussi les abonnements déjà rattachés."

#. module: bf_budget_subscription
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_budget_subscription.field_bf_budget_line__subscription_upcoming
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_budget_subscription.bf_budget_line_list_subscription
msgid "Upcoming renewals"
msgstr "Renouvellements à venir"

#. module: bf_budget_subscription
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_budget_subscription.field_bf_budget_subscription_link_wizard__preview
msgid "What will be done"
msgstr "Ce qui sera fait"

#. module: bf_budget_subscription
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_budget_subscription.field_bf_budget_line__subscription_upcoming
msgid ""
"What will fall due by the end of the fiscal year. It is known, dated and "
"contractual: it is already committed."
msgstr ""
"Ce qui tombera d'ici la fin de l'exercice. C'est connu, daté et contractuel "
": c'est déjà engagé."

#. module: bf_budget_subscription
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_budget_subscription.subscription_search_budget
msgid "Without a budget item"
msgstr "Sans poste budgétaire"

#. module: bf_budget_subscription
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_budget_subscription.subscription_search_budget
msgid "Without a schedule"
msgstr "Sans échéancier"

#. module: bf_budget_subscription
#. odoo-python
